{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19776","headline":"远愁曲 · 孟郊","name":"远愁曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飘颻何所从，遗塚行未逢。\n东西不见人，哭向青青松。\n此地有时尽，此哀无处容。\n声翻太白云，泪洗蓝田峰。\n水涉七八曲，山登千万重。\n愿邀玄夜月，出视白日踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}